{"id":"a8a8a9d3352a4c4f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral.md","title":"算术中的短二进制数码","display":"df-binary-arithmetic-numeral — 算术中的短二进制数码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral","aliases":["72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral"],"display":"df-binary-arithmetic-numeral — 算术中的短二进制数码","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §6.1.1, print578/PDF590; S(S0) spelling of 2","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source short-numeral construction, value and explicit tree-size bound checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"补出短数码对照的一元数码及常数2构造"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-binary-arithmetic-numeral — 算术中的短二进制数码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §6.1.1, print578/PDF590; S(S0) spelling of 2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source short-numeral construction, value and explicit tree-size bound checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"补出短数码对照的一元数码及常数2构造"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span> 由下式引入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(n)=\\min\\{k:n&lt;2^k\\}\">\\(\\lambda(n)=\\min\\{k:n&lt;2^k\\}\\)</span> 为已定义的数值位长，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(0)=0\">\\(\\lambda(0)=0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bn}(n)\">\\(\\operatorname{bn}(n)\\)</span> 是下式递归的闭项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(t)\">\\(s(t)\\)</span> 为闭算术项的节点数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，e∈{0,1}，后继二进制条款仅用于 n≥1。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span> 为标准结构。</li>\n<li>闭项集使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> 的一元数码递归也在下式列出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2:=S(S0),\\qquad\\overline0:=0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}:=S\\overline n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf2:=S(S0),\\qquad\\overline0:=0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}:=S\\overline n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{bn}(0)&amp;:=0,\\quad\\operatorname{bn}(1):=S0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bn}(2n+e)&amp;:=\\mathbf2\\cdot\\operatorname{bn}(n)+\\operatorname{bn}(e)\\quad(n\\ge1),\\\\\ns(0)&amp;:=1,\\quad s(St):=1+s(t),\\quad\ns(t+u):=s(t\\cdot u):=1+s(t)+s(u).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{bn}(0)&amp;:=0,\\quad\\operatorname{bn}(1):=S0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bn}(2n+e)&amp;:=\\mathbf2\\cdot\\operatorname{bn}(n)+\\operatorname{bn}(e)\\quad(n\\ge1),\\\\\ns(0)&amp;:=1,\\quad s(St):=1+s(t),\\quad\ns(t+u):=s(t\\cdot u):=1+s(t)+s(u).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\operatorname{bn}(n)\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm A}(\\operatorname{bn}(n))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\operatorname{bn}(n)\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm A}(\\operatorname{bn}(n))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}\\models\\operatorname{bn}(n)=\\overline n,\\qquad\ns(\\operatorname{bn}(n))\\le7\\lambda(n)+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}\\models\\operatorname{bn}(n)=\\overline n,\\qquad\ns(\\operatorname{bn}(n))\\le7\\lambda(n)+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二进制递归的输入约减为 floor(n/2)，每步只增加固定节点数；标准值由除二余数等式归纳得到。数码位长线性界不能用于一元数码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n0\">\\(S^n0\\)</span>。这里的 s 数语法树节点，二进制编码仍需通过原有通常编码的多项式比较；没有将节点数直接等同于任意自选编码位数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]] 的 $\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}$。$\\mathbf2$ 由下式引入；$\\lambda(n)=\\min\\{k:n<2^k\\}$ 为已定义的数值位长，$\\lambda(0)=0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(n)=\\min\\{k:n<2^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bn}(n)","display":false},{"tex":"s(t)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2:=S(S0),\\qquad\\overline0:=0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}:=S\\overline n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{bn}(0)&:=0,\\quad\\operatorname{bn}(1):=S0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bn}(2n+e)&:=\\mathbf2\\cdot\\operatorname{bn}(n)+\\operatorname{bn}(e)\\quad(n\\ge1),\\\\\ns(0)&:=1,\\quad s(St):=1+s(t),\\quad\ns(t+u):=s(t\\cdot u):=1+s(t)+s(u).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\operatorname{bn}(n)\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathrm A}(\\operatorname{bn}(n))=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}\\models\\operatorname{bn}(n)=\\overline n,\\qquad\ns(\\operatorname{bn}(n))\\le7\\lambda(n)+1.","display":true},{"tex":"S^n0","display":false}],"bytes":2410,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-537","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-532","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"6b353e786100a314","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"bn、λ 取 